    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in your [Charge phase](vsdata:core-rule/charge-phase), as a **GENESTEALER CULTS** unit of yours **declares a charge** while within 12\" of an **engaged** friendly **TYRANIDS** unit.\n\nThat **GENESTEALER CULTS** unit:\n\n- gets +1 to its **[Charge rolls](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step)**\n- may also re-roll its [Charge rolls](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step), but if it does, its **[Charge Move](vsdata:core-rule/charge-move)** must end engaged with any enemy unit that is engaged with that **TYRANIDS** unit",
